WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.749 --> 00:00:19.773
Mama was still frozen on the stoop, staring at Iris and Javier.

2
00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:22.435
"Tell me you didn't do this on purpose.

3
00:00:23.136 --> 00:00:24.657
Now I'll have to take you there."

4
00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:28.660
Iris couldn't bear the crushed look on Mama's face.

5
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:34.944
Mama was going to be late to her first day of work, and it was all their fault.

6
00:00:35.644 --> 00:00:37.666
Or rather, Javier's fault.

7
00:00:37.686 --> 00:00:44.871
"I'm sorry," Javier mumbled, but Iris could tell the apology wouldn't be enough.

8
00:00:45.831 --> 00:00:47.192
Mama's jaw clenched.

9
00:00:47.973 --> 00:00:48.713
"Take these."

10
00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:52.736
She shoved the lunches into Iris' hands.

11
00:00:52.756 --> 00:00:55.138
"I'm going to see if Mrs.

12
00:00:55.238 --> 00:00:57.740
Jones will lend me her car so I can drive you."

13
00:00:58.632 --> 00:01:00.132
She stormed back inside.

14
00:01:00.152 --> 00:01:04.434
"Good going, Javier."

15
00:01:05.214 --> 00:01:06.434
Iris rolled her eyes.

16
00:01:06.454 --> 00:01:08.715
"What kind of plan was that?"

17
00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:12.496
"I didn't think it through," he muttered.

18
00:01:12.516 --> 00:01:14.836
"No kidding."

19
00:01:15.637 --> 00:01:20.558
Iris handed one of the lunches to Javier and stuffed the other in her backpack.

20
00:01:24.179 --> 00:01:24.759
"Let's go."

21
00:01:25.639 --> 00:01:28.657
Moments later Mama returned, holding Mrs.

22
00:01:28.757 --> 00:01:30.017
Jones' car keys.

23
00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:34.520
She led the way around the corner to where the car was parked.

24
00:01:35.341 --> 00:01:36.882
Nobody said a word.

25
00:01:41.204 --> 00:01:47.168
Iris slipped into the backseat of the rusty Honda, hoping to stay as far from Mama as she

26
00:01:47.228 --> 00:01:49.930
could, and Javier did the same.

27
00:01:51.631 --> 00:01:52.992
Mama started up the car.

28
00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:00.002
"You see why I can't leave you two alone while I'm at work?

29
00:02:00.702 --> 00:02:02.843
This was completely irresponsible!"

30
00:02:02.863 --> 00:02:07.026
"I said I was sorry," Javier said.

31
00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:08.867
"I won't do it again."

32
00:02:08.887 --> 00:02:11.148
"No, you won't.

33
00:02:11.968 --> 00:02:16.951
Tomorrow I'll have to watch you to make sure you have everything and get on that bus."

34
00:02:17.931 --> 00:02:21.293
She braked at a traffic light and turned around to face them.

35
00:02:21.313 --> 00:02:28.177
"Also, in case you were wondering, you're both grounded."

36
00:02:28.197 --> 00:02:31.958
"What?" Iris sat straight up.

37
00:02:31.978 --> 00:02:34.479
"I had nothing to do with this."

38
00:02:34.499 --> 00:02:37.100
"I don't want to hear it!"

39
00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:38.981
Mama held up a hand.

40
00:02:39.001 --> 00:02:44.523
"No gaming or soccer or friends for the rest of the week."

41
00:02:45.263 --> 00:02:46.864
No soccer or friends?

42
00:02:47.624 --> 00:02:50.325
Iris scrunched down on the seat, miserable.

43
00:02:51.346 --> 00:02:53.687
Sometimes she liked having a twin brother.

44
00:02:54.247 --> 00:02:57.953
But today was definitely not one of those days!

45
00:02:57.973 --> 00:03:03.215
"Be good at camp," Mama said when she dropped them off.

46
00:03:03.236 --> 00:03:06.537
"Both of you had better keep out of trouble."

47
00:03:06.557 --> 00:03:09.519
"Bye, Mama," Iris said.

48
00:03:09.539 --> 00:03:11.220
"Good luck at work."

49
00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:18.384
Mama only waved in return, and Iris knew it was because she was still mad at them.

50
00:03:19.264 --> 00:03:26.408
Javier headed toward a table with a huge sign: Welcome to Camp Tennis 4 All.

51
00:03:29.152 --> 00:03:31.313
With a sigh, Iris followed him.

52
00:03:33.754 --> 00:03:41.117
Two older teenagers stood behind the table, bright smiles on their faces and name tags stuck on their

53
00:03:41.197 --> 00:03:42.278
white tennis outfits.

54
00:03:43.238 --> 00:03:46.800
The girl had blond hair pulled back in a sporty ponytail.

55
00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:50.401
According to her name tag, she was Ally.

56
00:03:51.262 --> 00:03:52.922
The boy's name was Trent.

57
00:03:54.363 --> 00:03:59.126
As Iris and Javier approached, Trent squinted at a clipboard.

58
00:03:59.146 --> 00:04:02.708
"These are the last ones!"

59
00:04:03.388 --> 00:04:04.449
he called to someone.

60
00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.571
"You must be Iris and Javier."

61
00:04:08.312 --> 00:04:12.855
He handed them each a name tag and placed a check mark next to their names on a

62
00:04:12.915 --> 00:04:16.878
list. "All right, then."

63
00:04:17.578 --> 00:04:21.761
A gray-haired woman wearing a visor stepped out of a small building.

64
00:04:22.742 --> 00:04:25.824
She took the clipboard from Trent as if she was in charge.

65
00:04:27.188 --> 00:04:32.691
"You two can come along with me for announcements, and then we'll split everyone up into groups for

66
00:04:32.751 --> 00:04:41.796
lessons." The woman led the way to a field beside the tennis courts, where about twenty kids were

67
00:04:41.816 --> 00:04:42.877
gathered on bleachers.

68
00:04:44.378 --> 00:04:45.478
Iris stared.

69
00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:49.281
Everyone else was wearing brightly colored tennis outfits.

70
00:04:50.621 --> 00:04:55.004
Iris glanced down at her navy blue gym shorts and black T-shirt.

71
00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.202
It was the outfit she often wore to soccer practice.

72
00:04:59.122 --> 00:05:04.645
It looked similar to what Javier was wearing but nothing like the other kids' clothes.

73
00:05:04.665 --> 00:05:08.987
"This is not the way to blend in," she thought.

74
00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:15.811
She glanced at Javier, but he simply shrugged and climbed the bleachers to sit next to another boy

75
00:05:15.871 --> 00:05:16.812
sitting by himself.

76
00:05:18.432 --> 00:05:20.173
Iris sat below Javier.

77
00:05:20.193 --> 00:05:22.475
"Good morning!"

78
00:05:23.295 --> 00:05:24.636
the gray-haired woman said.

79
00:05:25.336 --> 00:05:27.337
"I'm Julie, the camp director.

80
00:05:28.118 --> 00:05:30.119
The schedule for today is simple.

81
00:05:30.939 --> 00:05:35.082
We'll divide you into two groups and do some tryouts on the courts.

82
00:05:36.222 --> 00:05:39.004
Then we'll put you in groups based on your abilities."

83
00:05:39.704 --> 00:05:41.565
She tapped a pen on her clipboard.

84
00:05:41.585 --> 00:05:45.307
"After lunch, you'll begin lessons.

85
00:05:46.048 --> 00:05:49.870
Who's looking forward to the next three weeks at Camp Tennis 4 All?"

86
00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:53.332
"Me!" shouted most of the kids.

87
00:05:54.468 --> 00:05:56.229
Iris turned to look at Javier.

88
00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:01.313
He was just sitting there, but the boy next to him pumped his fist in the air.

89
00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:04.815
"Woo!" he called.

90
00:06:05.376 --> 00:06:10.399
The boy's dark hair was short and spiky, and his name tag read, Jae.

91
00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.482
He had deep brown eyes and a nice smile.

92
00:06:14.502 --> 00:06:18.385
"A very nice smile," thought Iris.

93
00:06:19.065 --> 00:06:21.407
Jae pointed from Javier to Iris.

94
00:06:21.427 --> 00:06:22.948
"Twins, right?"

95
00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:25.381
Iris and Javier nodded.

96
00:06:25.401 --> 00:06:27.663
"Yep," Javier said.

97
00:06:27.683 --> 00:06:31.166
"Twins who are identically bad at tennis!"

98
00:06:32.007 --> 00:06:32.707
Iris joked.

99
00:06:33.788 --> 00:06:36.150
"I love tennis," Jae said.

100
00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.252
"At least, I think I do.

101
00:06:38.832 --> 00:06:40.754
This is my first time at tennis camp.

102
00:06:41.795 --> 00:06:46.899
I haven't played a lot of real tennis, but I play table tennis in my basement every day."

103
00:06:46.919 --> 00:06:48.841
"Table tennis?"

104
00:06:49.541 --> 00:06:50.302
Javier said.

105
00:06:50.322 --> 00:06:53.896
"You mean, like Ping-Pong?"

106
00:06:53.916 --> 00:06:55.477
"Yes." Jae nodded.

107
00:06:55.497 --> 00:06:57.858
"I'm the state youth champion."

108
00:06:57.878 --> 00:07:02.260
"Wow." Iris raised her eyebrows.

109
00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:08.602
She didn't know much about table tennis, but to be state champion at anything was impressive.

110
00:07:08.622 --> 00:07:14.184
"My soccer team made it to the state playoffs last year, but we didn't win."

111
00:07:14.204 --> 00:07:16.766
"Listen up, everyone!"

112
00:07:17.306 --> 00:07:19.186
the counselor named Trent called out.

113
00:07:19.207 --> 00:07:22.508
"Ally's going to take the younger kids.

114
00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:26.463
If you're 13 or 14, you're coming with me."

115
00:07:27.584 --> 00:07:30.487
Iris joined the older group with Jae and Javier.

116
00:07:30.507 --> 00:07:34.310
"Let's get started," Trent said with a grin.

117
00:07:35.391 --> 00:07:40.135
He picked up a basket of tennis balls and headed over to one of the courts, where a

118
00:07:40.295 --> 00:07:42.137
big crate of rackets sat.

119
00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.884
you didn't bring your own racket, grab one and find a partner."

120
00:07:51.536 --> 00:07:54.037
Iris certainly hadn't brought her own racket.

121
00:07:54.617 --> 00:07:57.558
She got one, and so did Javier and Jae.

122
00:07:58.638 --> 00:07:59.838
"You want to be partners?"

123
00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:01.259
Jae asked her.

124
00:08:02.019 --> 00:08:04.720
Yes. Yes, she did.

125
00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:07.381
"Sure," Iris said.

126
00:08:07.941 --> 00:08:13.222
Javier paired up with a girl with blond hair and headed to the other end of the court.

127
00:08:16.603 --> 00:08:18.604
Iris noticed him smiling a bit too.

128
00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:22.713
Maybe tennis camp would be fun for both of them after all.

129
00:08:23.773 --> 00:08:27.754
Once everyone was ready, Trent tossed some balls to each pair.

130
00:08:27.774 --> 00:08:32.476
"Just hit it back and forth to each other, and I'll observe and give you tips."

131
00:08:37.097 --> 00:08:38.917
He began walking around the court.

132
00:08:42.318 --> 00:08:45.999
Iris flushed, remembering her attempt at tennis with Molly.

133
00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:49.376
Then she glanced at Jae.

134
00:08:49.396 --> 00:08:52.518
She hoped she wasn't about to embarrass herself again.
